// BT-3913: the field write before a nested `do:separatedBy:` in an actor loop
// nest is not lost when the nested accumulator seeds from the cell. Each
// inner pass adds 1 + 10 + 2 = 13 to `t`; the 2 x 2 passes add 1 to `n` each.
// See fixtures/bt3913nested_seed_actor.bt.

TestCase subclass: Bt3913NestedSeedTest

  testFieldWriteSurvivesTheNestedSeed =>
    self assert: Bt3913NestedSeedActor spawn run equals: #[52, 4]
